#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_asset_gps_hr
msgid ""
"===================================\n"
"GPS Tracking - Asset HR Integration\n"
"===================================\n"
"\n"
"Bridges GPS tracking with HR operator assignments, displaying driver/operator\n"
"information directly in the GPS dashboard and reports.\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Show operator name in GPS device dashboard kanban cards\n"
"* Show asset license plate alongside device info\n"
"* Operator column in GPS devices list view\n"
"* Quick access to operator details from GPS dashboard\n"
"* Operator dimension in GPS Log Report (filter/group by driver)\n"
"* Vehicle trip report with attendance-based driver assignment\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Once installed, the module auto-activates when its dependencies are met:\n"
"\n"
"1. Navigate to **IoT > GPS Tracking > Devices** to see operator info on device cards\n"
"2. Use the **Vehicle Trip Report** under Reports to analyze trips by driver\n"
"3. Filter GPS logs by operator in the pivot/graph views\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Authors\n"
"~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"* AgroMarin\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"This module is maintained by AgroMarin.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_telegram_bot_approval_automation_account
msgid ""
"=====================================\n"
"Telegram Bot Approval Account\n"
"=====================================\n"
"\n"
"This module extends telegram_bot to add payment approval request\n"
"management features through Telegram.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Multi-step payment approval workflow (details → proof → confirmation)\n"
"* File handling (photos, PDFs) for payment proof\n"
"* Partner validation and CFDI use resolution\n"
"* Bank statement line linking\n"
"* Automatic accounting operation creation on approval\n"
"* State management for chat sessions\n"
"\n"
"Commands\n"
"--------\n"
"\n"
"* ``/pago`` - Start payment registration workflow\n"
"* ``/cancelarpago`` - Cancel current payment workflow\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Configure your Telegram bot in the Telegram Bot settings and ensure\n"
"the approval workflow is properly set up.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"1. Send ``/pago`` to start a new payment registration\n"
"2. Follow the prompts to enter payment details\n"
"3. Upload payment proof (photo or PDF)\n"
"4. Confirm the payment details\n"
"5. The approval request will be created automatically\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/AgroMarin/agromarin-addons/issues>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Authors\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* AgroMarin\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"* AgroMarin Development Team\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
"This module is maintained by AgroMarin.\n"
msgstr ""

